OL,3,AShip sinks and crew missing after Black
OL,4,ASea drone attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA civilian cargo ship has sunk and its
OL,7,Fcrew is missing after being attacked by
OL,8,Fdrones in the Black Sea, Bulgarian
OL,9,Fofficials say.
OL,11,FA second vessel - carrying grain - was
OL,12,Falso hit within Bulgaria's exclusive
OL,13,Feconomic zone, Prime Minister Rumen
OL,14,FRadev said. Its 18 crew were rescued.
OL,16,FRadev did not say who was behind the
OL,17,Fattacks, which come as Russia
OL,18,Fintensifies strikes in the Black Sea,
OL,19,Fparticularly the eastern side, as part
OL,20,Fof its war against Ukraine.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
